{
  "//": [
    "Season -> period-correct equipment.",
    "",
    "Equipment lives in the save's CharacterVisuals table, not the Player",
    "table. See docs/Schema.md Group 6 for the decode.",
    "",
    "THREE RULES:",
    "",
    "1. LINEAGE, NOT UNIFORMITY. A player's current helmet decides what they",
    "   move to -- by exact model where an era distinguishes them (byModel),",
    "   otherwise by manufacturer (byBrand). Riddell's line splits in the",
    "   2000s: an Axiom wearer belongs in a VSR-4, a SpeedFlex wearer in a",
    "   Revolution. Brands that did not exist yet take the fallback.",
    "",
    "2. MASKS FOLLOW POSITION. Offensive and defensive linemen are separate",
    "   roles: on a Revolution a centre wears revofullcage and an edge rusher",
    "   RevoRobot. Where an era wants variety instead (the 1980s line), a",
    "   linemanMaskPool is spread deterministically by the player's own row.",
    "",
    "3. NOTHING UNCONFIRMED IS EVER WRITTEN. Every asset name below was read",
    "   out of a real export after being set in the community roster editor.",
    "   A season no era covers changes nothing.",
    "",
    "Naming note: the game's asset names are not its UI labels. The Riddell",
    "VSR-4 is GearHelmet_standardBrady, and the shell the editor calls",
    "'Schutt Air XP' -- really the Air Advantage -- is GearHelmet_Schutt,",
    "which is a different asset from GearHelmet_AirXP (the Air XP Pro VTD)."
  ],

