      "//": [
        "The Revolution arrived in 2002 and was on 83% of NFL players by 2008;",
        "the VSR-4 it replaced stayed in college use alongside it through 2010.",
        "So the split is by model lineage: a SpeedFlex wearer -> Revolution, an",
        "Axiom wearer -> VSR-4. Schutt gets the Air Advantage.",
        "No Revolution two-bar has been demonstrated, so quarterbacks take the",
        "skill mask (RevoRobot2) rather than an invented one."
      ],
